AWASIO
Interior Designer & Design Company Listing
Product Requirements Document (PRD)

Version: 1.0
Status: Finalized Product Requirements
Module: Interior Designer Marketplace
Platform: Awasio
Scope: Listing Creation, Business Configuration and Listing Management

1. Product Overview

Awasio will introduce an Interior Designer & Design Company listing vertical within its existing property and flatmate ecosystem.

The objective is to allow independent interior designers, architects, interior design studios and interior execution companies to create professional business listings using their existing Awasio accounts.

The module will provide homeowners with the ability to discover interior professionals, compare services, understand material specifications, compare pricing packages and submit project enquiries.

The interior listing must integrate with Awasio's existing common user profile, Organization functionality and credit wallet.

1.1 Finalized Business Rules
A single Awasio account will be used across all platform activities.
No separate authentication system will be created for interior designers.
Individual designers can create one interior business listing and manage one primary operating location.
Companies must use their existing Awasio Organization.
Companies can create multiple branches under one company listing.
Both starting-price and material-based package pricing must be supported.
Custom-quotation-only pricing must also be supported.
At least one approved completed portfolio project is mandatory before publication.
Material specifications must be captured separately from package pricing and actual project materials.
Existing property and flatmate listing workflows must remain unchanged.
Existing Awasio credit wallet functionality will be reused.
2. Account and Listing Ownership
2.1 Individual Interior Designer

An existing Awasio user can activate an Individual Interior Designer listing.

Information includes:

Designer name.
Professional profile.
Business name.
Profile photograph.
Professional experience.
Primary operating location.
Services and specializations.
Materials and brands.
Pricing packages.
Completed projects.
Credentials.
Contact information.

Individual designers cannot create multiple branches.

2.2 Interior Design Company

An existing Awasio Organization owner can activate an Interior Design Company listing.

The existing Organization will remain the primary business identity.

Company-level information includes:

Company name.
Logo.
Business description.
Registered office information.
Website and social links.
Central contact information.
Company credentials.
Common portfolio.
Company-wide services.

The company can add multiple branches.

Each branch can independently configure:

Address and contact information.
Services.
Service locations.
Material availability.
Pricing packages.
Starting prices.
Consultation availability.
Working hours.
Project acceptance status.
