8. Step 5 – Pricing and Packages

Awasio will support two mandatory pricing capabilities:

Starting Price.
Material-Based Packages.

Providers can additionally choose Custom Quotation Only.

8.1 Starting Price Configuration
Field	Requirement
Pricing type	Mandatory
Minimum price	Mandatory when publishing a rate
Maximum price	Optional
Pricing unit	Mandatory
Applicable service	Mandatory
Applicable branch	Mandatory for companies
Material level	Mandatory
Material included	Yes / No
Labour included	Yes / No
Design included	Yes / No
Installation included	Yes / No
GST included	Yes / No
Exclusions	Recommended

Supported pricing units:

Per sq.ft.
Per room.
Per unit.
Fixed price.
Per project.
Custom quotation.

Custom quotation-only providers can publish without displaying a numeric starting price.

8.2 Material-Based Packages

Providers can create multiple packages.

Illustrative example:

Package	Starting Price
Essential	₹1,400/sq.ft.
Premium	₹1,900/sq.ft.
Luxury	₹2,600/sq.ft.

These are sample prices and not prescribed market rates.

