13. Public Listing Page Requirements

The public profile should display information in the following order:

Business Overview.
About Company / Designer.
Services.
Branches and Service Locations.
Pricing and Packages.
Material Specifications.
Portfolio.
Team.
Credentials and Verification.
Warranty and After-Sales Service.
Reviews.
Contact and Enquiry.
13.1 Search Listing Card

Display:

Business name.
Logo or cover photograph.
Verification badge, where approved.
Provider type.
Primary city and locality.
Experience.
Starting price or Custom Quote label.
Available package names.
Primary services.
Number of branches.
Completed portfolio count.

Do not overload the search card with detailed material specifications.

