Branch-level promotions.
Enhanced lead management.
18. Final Product Direction

Awasio should treat the Interior Designer module as a reusable professional business listing rather than a basic classified advertisement.

The provider should manage business identity, branches, service capabilities, material specifications, pricing packages, completed projects and customer enquiries through one common Awasio dashboard.

This structure will allow Awasio to introduce additional professional service categories in the future without disrupting its existing property search, property listing, flatmate search and flatmate listing ecosystem.

